{
  "name": "2026 Electrical Design Guide",
  "short_name": "2026 ElecDesign",
  "description": "Offline-first 2026 electrical engineering reference and interactive calculators for illumination, general design, conduit sizing, conductor sizing, OCPD, 3-phase load balancing, equipment sizing, grounding, and metering.",
